      "v": 10,
      "zh": "求你赐我智慧聪明，我好在这民前出入；不然，谁能判断这众多的民呢？」",
      "en": "Now give me wisdom and discernment so[NOTE:1] I can effectively lead this nation.[NOTE:2] Otherwise[NOTE:3] no one is able[NOTE:4] to make judicial decisions for[NOTE:5] this great nation of yours.”[NOTE:6]",
