    {
      "v": 11,
      "zh": "神对所罗门说：「我已立你作我民的王。你既有这心意，并不求资财、丰富、尊荣，也不求灭绝那恨你之人的性命，又不求大寿数，只求智慧聪明好判断我的民；",
      "en": "God said to Solomon, “Because you desire this,[NOTE:1] and did not ask for riches, wealth, and honor, or for vengeance on your enemies,[NOTE:2] and because you did not ask for long life,[NOTE:3] but requested wisdom and discernment so you can make judicial decisions for my people over whom I have made you king,",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “because this was in your heart.”",
        "Heb “the life of those who hate you.”",
